@startuml narcology-model-en
hide circle
hide empty members
title How a narcology registry record fits together

class Patient [[https://dhp.uz/fhir/core/StructureDefinition-uz-core-patient.html{Open the UZ Core Patient profile}]]
class Encounter [[https://dhp.uz/fhir/core/StructureDefinition-uz-core-encounter.html{Open the UZ Core Encounter profile}]]
class Condition [[https://dhp.uz/fhir/core/StructureDefinition-uz-core-condition.html{Open the UZ Core Condition profile}]]
class SocioeconomicObservation [[https://dhp.uz/fhir/core/StructureDefinition-uz-core-socioeconomic-observation.html{Open the UZ Core Socioeconomic Observation profile}]]
class NarcologyEpisodeOfCare [[StructureDefinition-narcology-episode-of-care.html{Open the NarcologyEpisodeOfCare profile}]] #E8F0FE
class NarcologyObservation [[StructureDefinition-narcology-observation.html{Open the NarcologyObservation profile}]] #E8F0FE
class NarcologyPsychiatryFlag [[StructureDefinition-narcology-psychiatry-flag.html{Open the NarcologyPsychiatryFlag profile}]] #E8F0FE

Patient "1" <-- "0..*" NarcologyEpisodeOfCare : « patient »
Patient "1" <-- "0..*" SocioeconomicObservation : « subject »
NarcologyEpisodeOfCare "0..*" --> "0..*" Condition : « diagnosis.condition »
NarcologyEpisodeOfCare "0..*" <-- "0..*" Encounter : « episodeOfCare »
Patient "0..1" <-- "0..*" Encounter : « subject »
Patient "1" <-- "0..*" Condition : « subject »
Condition "0..*" <-right- "0..*" Encounter : «  diagnosis.condition  »
' norank gives this link its own SVG id; two ranked links between the same classes share one
Encounter "0..1" <-[norank]- "0..*" Condition : «   encounter   »
Encounter "0..1" <--- "0..*" NarcologyPsychiatryFlag : « encounter »
Encounter "0..1" <-- "0..*" NarcologyObservation : « encounter »
Patient "1" <-- "0..*" NarcologyPsychiatryFlag : « subject »
Patient "0..1" <-- "0..*" NarcologyObservation : « subject »

caption Clinical graph: references to organizations, practitioners and other actors are left out to keep the diagram readable.

@enduml
